{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44918","headline":"送韩校书赴江西 · 无可","name":"送韩校书赴江西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车马东门别，扬帆过楚津。\n花繁期到幕，雪在已离秦。\n吟落江沙月，行飞驿骑尘。\n猨声孤岛雨，草色五湖春。\n折苇鸣风岸，遥烟起暮苹。\n鄱江连郡府，高兴寄何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}